{
  "declined": "none",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "task",
      "score": 4,
      "reason": "文章回答了題目並表明立場（\"learning online by yourself is better\"），語氣與任務相符，但可以更平衡地討論教師的優點以完全回應比較任務。"
    },
    {
      "id": "organization",
      "score": 4,
      "reason": "有清楚的段落結構（引言、兩點論證、結論），並使用連接詞如 \"First\", \"Second\", \"Of course\" 來組織內容，少數過渡可以更自然。"
    },
    {
      "id": "vocabulary",
      "score": 3,
      "reason": "詞彙基本足夠並能表達意思，但有幾處用詞不準確，如 \"an useful place\", \"many informations\"。"
    },
    {
      "id": "grammar",
      "score": 3,
      "reason": "句子結構大致正確且易懂，但有幾個文法錯誤（冠詞、複數、可數名詞）和少量拼寫或搭配問題。"
    }
  ],
  "issues": [
    {
      "quote": "an useful place",
      "type": "article",
      "why": "在以母音音素開頭的單字前應用不定冠詞 \"an\"，但此處 \"useful\" 發音以 /j/ 開頭（像 y），所以應用 \"a\"。",
      "suggestion": "a useful place"
    },
    {
      "quote": "many informations",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "\"information\" 是不可數名詞，不能用複數形式或與 \"many\" 連用。",
      "suggestion": "a lot of information"
    },
    {
      "quote": "You can also choose topics that you are interested in, such as sports or cooking.",
      "type": "sentence",
      "why": "語句本身正確但可以更自然地用動名詞結構或把關係子句簡化以提高流暢度。",
      "suggestion": "You can also choose topics that interest you, such as sports or cooking."
    }
  ],
  "more": [
    {
      "quote": "On YouTube and podcasts, you can find many informations about grammar, pronunciation and culture, and most of it is free.",
      "type": "punctuation",
      "why": "句子較長，逗號連接兩個獨立子句可以改為分號或分成兩句以提高清晰度。",
      "suggestion": "On YouTube and in podcasts you can find a lot of information about grammar, pronunciation, and culture. Most of it is free."
    },
    {
      "quote": "With online resources, you can study for twenty minutes on the bus or before you go to bed.",
      "type": "word-choice",
      "why": "\"study for twenty minutes\" 可以保留，但可用 \"study in twenty-minute sessions\" 更自然且常見。",
      "suggestion": "study in twenty-minute sessions"
    },
    {
      "quote": "Of course, a teacher can correct your mistakes.",
      "type": "cohesion",
      "why": "這一句提出教師的優點但未深入比較，若加上例子（immediate feedback, personalized guidance）會更有說服力。",
      "suggestion": "Of course, a teacher can give immediate feedback and personalized guidance."
    },
    {
      "quote": "These days, there are many ways to learn English.",
      "type": "tone",
      "why": "開頭句清楚但較一般；可以用更具體的背景或數據來吸引讀者。",
      "suggestion": "Nowadays, there are many different ways to learn English."
    },
    {
      "quote": "However, if you are motivated, you can make great progress by yourself.",
      "type": "cohesion",
      "why": "結論句簡潔，但可以更強化論點，例如指出如何保持動機或自學成功的要素。",
      "suggestion": "However, with motivation and a clear study plan, you can still make great progress on your own."
    }
  ],
  "strengths": [
    {
      "quote": "learning online by yourself is better",
      "why": "明確表達作者立場，讓讀者知道整篇文章的中心觀點。"
    },
    {
      "quote": "Students in Taiwan are very busy, so it is hard to go to a class at a fixed time.",
      "why": "使用具體背景（台灣學生）作為論據，讓論點更具說服力。"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "你的文章結構清楚，立場明確，且具體舉例使論點有說服力。下一步請注意不可數名詞（information）的用法和冠詞（a/an）的選擇，並嘗試在比較時多用具體例子或細節來支持教師的優點，讓論證更平衡與完整。"
}
